  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&apos;AI Accelerator&apos; -Scaling -AI4D</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to facilitate the transition from innovative AI solutions to scalable applications that address development challenges in sub-Saharan Africa and Indo-Pacific . A dedicated AI Accelerator will be established to identify and support sustainable AI initiatives. The Foreign, Commonwealth &amp; Development Office (FCDO) is allocating up to &#xa3;5 million of the total programme budget for this purpose. This initiative will involve collaboration with other donors and private sector partners to pool resources and expertise. Together, we will select a suitable partner to deliver the AI Accelerator, ensuring that the supported AI solutions are impactful and sustainable in addressing key development issues in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
